   <narrative xml:lang="SV">J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetskommission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Third phase of the establishment of an Equal Opportunities Commission, which is expected to result in that the Commission will be established. The process for establishment of the Commission is strongly backed by the civil society and women&apos;s movement.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tredje fasen av etablerandet av en J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetskommission (Equal Opportunities Commission), vilket f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas resultera i att  kommissonen slutligen etableras. Processen fram till etablerandet av Kommissionen har starkt st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n civila samh&#xe4;llet och kvinnor&#xf6;relsen i Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
